I love these kinds of applications and the creativity and boldness of organizations in pursuing them. Benefiting humanity takes on many forms; initiatives like this are just such an unambiguous benefit.

@woj_zaremba: "OpenAI Foundation is taking an end-to-end approach to tackling Alzheimer's with AI. We're supporting the full spectrum of work — from early diagnosis and better understanding of the disease to accelerating new drug discovery. This month, we're finalizing over $100M in grants across six institutions to advance this comprehensive effort."

The OpenAI Foundation is working to finalize more than $100 million in initial grants across six research institutions to support AI for Alzheimer’s research.
